  "description": "TIYKOE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H100 Dy4 N12 O22. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.556-3.854 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.66-111.09°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H100N12O22Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
